From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:15:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] packing/shaders: refresh Stardew Valley, Animal Crossing and
 Captain Toad maps

Commit 8d62601f switched main's duplicate shader selection in shader_split.py
from last-copy to checked first-copy. Refresh three more registered profiles
from fresh full splits on their registered builds so strict packing checks pass:

- Stardew Valley (0100E65002BB8000, v1310720, main e7f84509): 66 main MGFX
  occurrences reduce to 64 keys with byte-identical duplicate controls and code;
  14 rows updated (2 source labels, 12 ps_main.bin indices), all 65 keys and
  facts/pairs unchanged.
- Animal Crossing: New Horizons (01006F8002326000, v2228224, main ff1d1c05):
  96 main BNSH occurrences reduce to 40 keys with byte-identical duplicate
  controls and code; 36 rows updated (22 source labels, 14 indices), all 9,766
  keys, non-main rows, and facts/pairs/pso_pairs unchanged.
- Captain Toad: Treasure Tracker (01009BF0072D4000, v393216, main 41eae379):
  96 main BNSH occurrences reduce to 40 keys with byte-identical duplicate
  controls and code; 36 rows updated (22 source labels, 14 indices), all 7,258
  keys, non-main rows, and facts/pairs/pso_pairs unchanged.

Refs #2924

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#3096
Reason: Refresh Stardew Valley, Animal Crossing and Captain Toad shader maps for 8d62601f
Issue: none

